WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.111
&gt;&gt; BEFORE WE EAT, I WANT TO SAY
A FEW WORDS.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MAKE IT QUICK, DAD.
I'M STARVING.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.516
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO THANK EVERYONE FOR
BEING HERE.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
NOT JUST THE IMMEDIATE FAMILY.
I'M TALKING ABOUT ALL THE

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:23.823
COUSINS AND KIDS AND EVERYBODY.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S HOW IT SHOULD BE.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:27.894
&gt;&gt; I KNOW EVERYBODY IS BUSY WITH
THEIR LIVES.

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.429
THEIR OWN THINGS THEY HAVE TO DO
BUT IT MEANS SO MUCH THAT YOU'RE

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
HERE IN OUR HOME FOR THE
HOLIDAYS.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:38.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT GOES FOR BOTH OF US.
&gt;&gt; MY SISTER'S HOUSE --

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE TO PAY FOR ALL THIS
FOOD?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
HELL NO.
&gt;&gt; AS I HAVE ALWAYS SAID, THIS

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
HOUSE IS HAPPIER WHEN IT'S IF
YOU HAVE.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:52.519
&gt;&gt; GET OUT OF THE BATHROOM!
&gt;&gt; SO YOU'VE BEEN SUCH GRACIOUS

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:58.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
HOSTS.
I HOPE I HAVEN'T BEEN A

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:04.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
NUISANCE.
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:09.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
WE LOVE HAVING YOU HERE.
&gt;&gt; AND OF COURSE, THIS IS OUR

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:13.907
FIRST CHRISTMAS WITH OUR SOON TO
BE SON-IN-LAW MATTHEW.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:18.945
WHEN YOU TWO GOT ENGAGED, ALL OF
US WERE SMILING FROM EAR TO EAR.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHY CANNOT I MARRY HIM?
BECAUSE HE'S WHITE?

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:25.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; WELCOME TO THE FAMILY,

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.887
MATTHEW.
&gt;&gt; YOU GUYS ARE BEING SO RACIST.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:34.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DAMN RIGHT WE ARE.
&gt;&gt; NO OFFENSE.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:35.929
&gt;&gt; NONE TAKEN.
&gt;&gt; I'M JUST EMBARRASSED WE HAVE

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO PUT YOU TWO ON THE AIR
MATTRESS.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:44.270
&gt;&gt; FOR THE LAST TIME, IT'S FINE.
&gt;&gt; IT'S ACTUALLY SUPER

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
COMFORTABLE.
&gt;&gt; AND THEN THERE IS BRIAN.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:49.542
BACK FROM COLLEGE.
IT SURE IS GREAT TO HAVE MY BOY

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:53.580
BACK HOME FOR A FEW WEEKS.
&gt;&gt; IT FEELS GOOD TO BE HOME,

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
DAD.
&gt;&gt; I AM PUSHING IT.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO.
NO.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:03.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GET YOUR USELESS BLACK ASS
OUT OF HERE.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:09.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
SON, GET BACK IN HERE.
&gt;&gt; WELL, I JUST WANT TO SAY AS

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.498
YOU GET OLDER, IT ALL GOES THAT
MUCH QUICKER.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:15.602
WE SHOULD ALL CHERISH THIS TIME
WE ALL SPEND TOGETHER AT

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:25.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
CHRISTMAS.
&gt;&gt; I KNOW I WILL.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt; I COULD GO ON.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:31.618
BUT I KNOW BETTER THAN TO LET A
MEAL MY WIFE SPENT SO MUCH TIME

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:34.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
COOKING GO COLD.
&gt;&gt; OH, STOP.

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:41.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
I JUST THREW IT TOGETHER.
NO, NO, NO!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ANYWAY, THANK YOU ALL FOR
BEING HERE.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND I REALLY MEAN THAT.
I KNOW IT MIGHT BE A LITTLE

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:49.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
CROWDED --
&gt;&gt; THIS ROOM IS OFF LIMITS.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:51.271
&gt;&gt; GET OFF ME!
&gt;&gt; AND WE MIGHT EVEN GET ON EACH

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:55.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
OTHER'S NERVES.
&gt;&gt; WHATEVER IT IS, NO!

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:59.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS GOING TO MAKE THE
MEMORIES LAST A LIFETIME.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:03.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GRANDPA!
LOCK THE DOOR!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:08.788
&gt;&gt; CHRISTMAS IS ABOUT FAMILY.
AND I AM BLESSED TO SPEND IT

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:09.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
WITH MINE.
CHEERS!

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:15.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; CHEERS!
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS BEAUTIFUL, DAD.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:26.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL THAT, SON.
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS GREAT, DAD.

